# need diag(H) and tr(H)
# Hoffman (2013) doesn't included fixed effects

# A recap on Linear Mixed Models and their hat-matrices
or 
# https://riviste.unimi.it/index.php/ijphjournal/article/view/22694/20277
# https://rdrr.io/cran/lme4/man/hatvalues.merMod.html
# https://www.sfu.ca/sasdoc/sashtml/stat/chap41/sect23.htm

Best Linear Unbiased Predictor 
D Z^T V^{-1} (y - X\beta)

Since \beta = (X^T V^{-1} X)^{-1} X^T V^{-1} y, then
fitted value is 
X \beta = X (X^T V^{-1} X)^{-1} X^T V^{-1} y



H_1 = X (X^T V^{-1} X)^{-1} X^T V^{-1}
H_2 = I - V^{-1} + X (X^T V^{-1} X)^{-1} X^T V^{-1}

edf = tr(H)
rdf = tr((I-H)(I-H)) ??


